},{"q":"There is a picture ___ the wall.","a":"on","w":["in","at","from"]},{"q":"We have lunch ___ noon.","a":"at","w":["on","in","to"]}],"p":"\\b(on|at) (the|\\w+day|noon|night|nine|ten|six|eight)\\b"},{"id":"g15","num":8,"lv":"A1","en":"Possessives: my / your / his / her","ar":"صفات الملكية: my / your / his / her","explain":["صفات الملكية بتقول الحاجة بتاعة مين: my, your, his, her, its, our, their.","بنحطها قبل الاسم مباشرة: my book, her phone. ومبنحطش the معاها.","'s بتدل على الملكية مع الأسماء: Sara's bag = شنطة سارة."],"formulas":[["my / your / his / her + noun","my car, her bag"],["our / their + noun","our house, their garden"],["name + 's + noun","Ali's phone"]],"examples":[["This is my phone.","ده تليفوني."],["She loves her job.","هي بتحب شغلها."],["Ali's car is new.","عربية علي جديدة."],["Their house is near the park.","بيتهم قريب من الحديقة."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"Sara loves she mother.","r":"Sara loves her mother.","n":"قبل الاسم بنستخدم her مش she."},{"w":"This is the my book.","r":"This is my book.","n":"مفيش the مع my."}],"quiz":[{"q":"This is ___ bag. It belongs to me.","a":"my","w":["me","I","mine"]},{"q":"She loves ___ job.","a":"her","w":["she","hers","him"]},{"q":"Ali and Sara love ___ parents.","a":"their","w":["they","them","theirs"]},{"q":"___ car is very fast.","a":"Ahmed's","w":["Ahmeds","Ahmed","Ahmeds'"]},{"q":"We clean ___ room every week.","a":"our","w":["we","us","ours"]},{"q":"Is this ___ pen?","a":"your","w":["you","yours","yourself"]},{"q":"The dog is eating ___ food.","a":"its","w":["it's","it","itself"]},{"q":"He is washing ___ hands.","a":"his","w":["he","him","hers"]}],"p":"\\b(my|your|his|her|our|their) \\w+"},{"id":"g16","num":9,"lv":"A1","en":"Question words","ar":"كلمات الاستفهام","explain":["بنستخدم كلمات الاستفهام في أول السؤال: What (إيه)، Where (فين)، When (إمتى)، Why (ليه)، Who (مين)، How (إزاي).","بعد كلمة السؤال بنستخدم am / is / are أو do / does: Where is the bank? / Where do you live?","How much للسعر وغير المعدود، و Ho