e city which I was born.","r":"This is the city where I was born.","n":"للأماكن بنستخدم where."}],"quiz":[{"q":"The woman ___ lives next door is a nurse.","a":"who","w":["which","where","whose"]},{"q":"I lost the phone ___ my father gave me.","a":"that","w":["who","where","whose"]},{"q":"This is the restaurant ___ we had dinner.","a":"where","w":["who","which","whose"]},{"q":"He is a boy ___ father is a pilot.","a":"whose","w":["who","which","where"]},{"q":"The car ___ broke down is very old.","a":"which","w":["who","where","whose"]},{"q":"People ___ work hard usually succeed.","a":"who","w":["which","where","whose"]},{"q":"Cairo is the city ___ I was born.","a":"where","w":["who","which","whose"]},{"q":"A pen is a thing ___ you write with.","a":"that","w":["who","where","whose"]}],"p":"\\b(who|which|that|where|whose) \\w+"},{"id":"g23","num":23,"lv":"B1","en":"Passive voice","ar":"المبني للمجهول","explain":["بنستخدم المبني للمجهول لما الفاعل مش مهم أو مش معروف، ونركّز على اللي وقع عليه الفعل: The window was broken.","الصيغة: am / is / are / was / were + التصريف التالت للفعل. المضارع: is made. الماضي: was made.","لو عايزين نذكر الفاعل بنستخدم by: The book was written by Ali."],"formulas":[["is / are + V3 (present)","English is spoken here."],["was / were + V3 (past)","The room was cleaned."],["... by + agent","written by a student"]],"examples":[["Breakfast is served until ten.","الفطار بيتقدّم لحد العاشرة."],["The window was broken yesterday.","الشباك اتكسر امبارح."],["These cars are made in Egypt.","العربيات دي بتتصنّع في مصر."],["The letter was sent by Sara.","الجواب اتبعت من سارة."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"The window broke by the boy.","r":"The window was broken by the boy.","n":"لازم was + V3."},{"w":"English speaks here.","r":"English is spoken here.","n":"اللغة بتتتكلم (مبني للمجهول) فنستخدم is spoken."}],"quiz":[{"q":"This bridge ___ in 1990.","a":"was built","w":["built","is building","was build"]},{"q":"Cars ___ in this factory every day.","a":"are made","w":["